{"id":2712,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为严防宿舍火灾事故发生，切实保障研究生生命财产安全，5月22日下午，我院团委书记刘莉莉对研究生宿舍开展消防安全隐患专项排查工作。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VM472DMNQfMN7iUdzVVnNVRnR-iUlV-kM46Vo7LYL7-iMRN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkokh2oky8LzGiLNL4ozliM4QkMlCDolCPMN7DM4GiUmWFLN7PoRl8nmrFMlL4MmGJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYLRlJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7205&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CB8F841052C395576B5F69F16A6705B2/2A1854F5/5C360\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VMlM2VM8QRU4vDMdlLbMlUPMm-YM4W-RMNLYo7QRUNCbU8l0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYokyaoSyDLllbM4LaLl-8U8-8U4GYUlCsMRQ7nzLZMRQFnzCbLmlsLR6FL46Roz9YgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLmGigtA8pUWcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7205&e=.jpg\"></p><p>刘老师深入各研究生宿舍，重点排查易引发火灾的安全隐患，严查乱接插线板、违规电器使用、易燃杂物堆积、电线裸露等风险问题，同时对宿舍环境卫生、物品摆放等进行全面检查。对排查发现的隐患逐一提醒，督促同学们立即整改清理，切实消除火灾风险。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VU8r2VL8UZoR9PLdlr2MzVRMN7bnmr-2ozGsozlYMzNiMmN0gihFp2hmCIa0okyZMYhkUSyiL8LPL4lZMmAVnzWknmr7LllZLlUiMRGbMNrFMmNYM4QVMRfFL8lPol7Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYLRlJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7205&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/887BA53C135868EE2BF5D1E81D54096E/69276E40/3E19A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Vnm72ZMm9YnRN8odRA7MRM7o7-aLzA-fnNQkMz7sn7liMz-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hVoSy8LkhVLlUZnzvDM8-sMNCbL8UPMzl8MmW2L8WRUzTFU8-DU8C8LlWFLm7bU4GPgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLmGigtA8pUWcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7205&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次排查有效消除宿舍安全隐患，进一步强化研究生安全防范意识。我院将建立常态化消防安全排查机制，持续抓实宿舍安全管理，全力为同学们营造安全、整洁、文明、有序的住宿环境。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VM472DMNQfMN7iUdzVVnNVRnR-iUlV-kM46Vo7LYL7-iMRN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkokh2oky8LzGiLNL4ozliM4QkMlCDolCPMN7DM4GiUmWFLN7PoRl8nmrFMlL4MmGJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYLRlJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7205&e=.jpg"}